/-!
# Source-native finite centered reduced P286 entropy iteration

The reduced centered safe step already pays the complete recomputed `A/F/B`
relative action.  This module iterates that exact step at one material center
without a stopping branch or supplied future state.  The state carrier keeps
only the regularity and auxiliary-shell facts generated by each step.

The resulting normalized entropy is a finite calculation ledger.  It gives
an exact telescope and detects the centered defect, but it does not claim an
absolute lower bound, a global center scheduler, or compactness of the
configuration sequence.
-/

set_option autoImplicit false
set_option maxRecDepth 100000

namespace SaturationMonoid
namespace PhysicsCore
namespace StageNineP286SourceNativeCenteredReducedEntropyIteration

